    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f7bc59ffb8f1c8ee999a8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“──世界啊！\n我心爱的观测者们啊！永别了！\n酩酊大醉后，凝视我永恒的光芒吧──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c95451d61d394b2d28efb09e527763de436e560268e171313f5abd2416bcf55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1083/storytimeline_501083115.json",
