    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03dee5c941a4b4e6b2cb985",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒是个遣辞用句很难懂的赛马娘，\n但她不会说谎，\n或是毫无意义地扰乱他人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27abb9374f9e6faa8299755e5b5e2b710aa1a73dfef39fce4296085dbe83b7cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
